  "body": "Without a doubt, one of Orewa's best buys!\r\n\r\nJust 600 metres from the golden sands of Orewa Beach, this beautifully presented townhouse offers the perfect combination of modern style, everyday comfort, and an unbeatable coastal lifestyle. Only two years young and set on a FREEHOLD title, it's an exceptional opportunity for buyers seeking quality, convenience, and outstanding value.\r\n\r\nWhether you're stepping onto the property ladder, looking for a smart investment, searching for the perfect lock up and leave, or downsizing to an easy care lifestyle, this home ticks all the right boxes. Low maintenance by design, it's ideal for those who want to spend less time on upkeep and more time enjoying everything this vibrant seaside community has to offer. It also presents an excellent opportunity as a holiday home or AirBnB, allowing you to generate income while owning a slice of sought after Orewa.\r\n\r\nOne of only nine boutique terrace homes, this thoughtfully designed residence offers light filled open plan living, three generous bedrooms, and two beautifully appointed bathrooms. Cleverly configured to maximise natural light and elevated outlooks, every space feels bright, welcoming, and effortlessly liveable.\r\n\r\nQuality is evident throughout, with sleek stone benchtops, premium European Bosch appliances, double glazing, and contemporary finishes combining to create a home that's as practical as it is stylish.\r\n\r\nThe location is simply outstanding. Leave the car at home and enjoy an easy stroll to Orewa's vibrant cafés, restaurants, boutique shopping, supermarkets, and the stunning beach. Parks, reserves, scenic walking and cycling tracks are all close by, while motorway access is just minutes away, making commuting north or south a breeze.\r\n\r\nModern. Coastal. Effortless.\r\n\r\nAffordable opportunities this close to Orewa Beach are becoming increasingly rare. Whether you're looking for a permanent home, a weekend coastal escape, or an easy care investment, this is an opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\nViewing is easy. Call today and make this beautiful home yours.",
